%% Mermaid sequence diagram for attestation generation
sequenceDiagram
    actor HR as HR User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Spring Boot)
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant JR as JasperReports

    HR->>FE: Select employee and type
    FE->>BE: POST /api/attestations {employeId, typeAttestation}
    BE->>DB: Save attestation (date, type) to get ID
    BE->>JR: Compile/Fill JRXML (from DB or classpath)
    JR->>DB: Read data (via JDBC)
    JR-->>BE: PDF bytes
    BE->>DB: Update attestation with file path
    BE-->>FE: 200 OK (AttestationDto)
    FE->>BE: GET /api/attestations (refresh list)
    BE-->>FE: JSON list

